========================================================================
core = (1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 12, 13, 20, 46)
meas = 50189/3223220=0.015571   >= THR2 ? True   (carry tower 15 -> 11: lost bit 4)

OLD drop-6 mouths retained: 2/4
  mouth 1 [29/182,9/56] det=3 (R(13,2)->L(12,2)): KEPT 
  mouth 2 [29/168,27/154] det=5 (R(12,2)->L(11,2)): DESTROYED
  mouth 3 [127/154,139/168] det=5 (R(11,9)->L(12,10)): DESTROYED
  mouth 4 [47/56,153/182] det=3 (R(12,10)->L(13,11)): KEPT 

  => the two OUTER det=3 mouths (13->12, 12->13) survive;
     the two INNER det=5 mouths (12->11, 11->12) are carved up by the
     new tail speeds 20,46 (the {5:+2,23:+2} replacements).

